{"reference":"Lamentations 3","book":"Lamentations","chapter":3,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Voices and Hope","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The first-person “man” is unnamed, and attempts to identify him with a particular historical person go beyond the chapter. The poem also moves among an individual voice, communal speech, references to the daughter of the speaker’s people, enemies, and direct address to God. These voices should not be reduced securely to one biography. Wormwood in verses 15 and 19 is imagery for the bitterness of affliction remembered by the speaker.","verse_refs":["Lamentations 3:1-66","Lamentations 3:15","Lamentations 3:19","Lamentations 3:55-66"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_lamentations_003_676ed06e88de35d1cceddf47"]},{"id":"block_2","text":"Verses 21–33 turn toward hope by recalling God’s steadfast love, compassion, and faithfulness. Yet this is not a final resolution: the chapter returns to blocked prayer, violence, accusation, and petitions that persecutors be repaid. In verses 37–39, the term translated “evil” can denote calamity rather than moral evil, so the contrast there can be read as good and disaster coming under the Most High’s rule.","verse_refs":["Lamentations 3:1-66","Lamentations 3:19-24","Lamentations 3:37-39","Lamentations 3:40-66"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_lamentations_003_fa8f65623ed8780c5e86cc6b"]}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within the Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_3","text":"Lamentations is received as five poems with distinct voices and formal profiles. Chapters 1–4 use alphabetic structures, while chapter 5 has twenty-two lines without an alphabetic progression. This wider literary setting helps place the shifting voice and shape of chapter 3 within a collection rather than treating it as an isolated personal account.","verse_refs":["Lamentations 1:1-22","Lamentations 2:1-22","Lamentations 4:1-22","Lamentations 5:1-22"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_lamentations_003_c41e8566fc89c33bc725801b","reader_path_lamentations_003_13fbd13a18d68b21af2918cf"]}]}],"generated_metadata":null}